    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8235d4611d0fd53da682d42",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "新设立！URA总决赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "b980f921040c091528f39baa5730dbfc251615ce1b9457e0e8ba4e5cdad84eea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8511751b7db87cc460c13dee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "The Twinkle Legends",
      "source_fingerprint": "76c9e156b42fd2c671670b6d4f47f6970634f93c0292e1444f630f1ee31628c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:814b8201fcd704f78cabde33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欢迎来到无人岛\\n-DESIGN YOUR ISLAND-",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e666f289acdfeb3afaa261312af1fe44be335e6f43b56564acd4b894c1618df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c1540c01284659399cfc0c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "极乐♪汤驹温泉乡",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6d4e7cbe43ef1ea436382751f0ee711ca74b5f568b04ad42e62f58a75198b11",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:957986a8bd48fc7787dd3b82",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Beyond Dreams\\n共同向前、共觅荣光",
      "source_fingerprint": "be632ea04ecc71db641be70310f5683a60a36447125d540e9d3cd4f63ca14850",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e71e5ab45724e2616f3e05b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欢迎光临！特雷森轩！\\n～开始报恩了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fea651cf97d009a69265f93854e4f4efb46c629c1f3a50a19281953c0fb04b3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2002f76674184c317074ba79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "友朋，解读青史\\n——午式骏大祭——",
      "source_fingerprint": "919ada8a9a484d701eeaba06642ba3d6caaeee72a467abb9bb2a30923c409d0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6c9ca88f4110d19efd4a763",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "青春杯\\n～团队默契绽光芒～",
      "source_fingerprint": "30489279e28bca4ace246e5f43d581ddcfa76d4142ec402ff5d37e09396f47cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9307de4dbcad8fc6571ead58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "相连、相辉、相映。\\n属于我们的『Grand Live』",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a628cb61f3dcaece94c35a59b1443f0a92e2f43ff6c71fab0bf0af1189497dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa0a106da3771f9373a4720f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Make a new track!!\\n～巅峰赛开幕～",
      "source_fingerprint": "491d9529af17c3633a3f91f5ab18ce060ad9b6df8fe1f1b145dbb0aaad19af7b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e37c4ffd5802e5145a06743",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Grand Masters\\n-致继承者们-",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec408827d02762d60ef97b403ab0b4ded8edc8089a6b67c1cadf4269b258a955",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d498c3bb5b37c370e0fd2190",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Reach for the stars\\nL'Arc计划",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c455b9bb1c7cc3ede2d2f3555a05a7f43f9fe864c783a38494535621ab786d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cc1c741667aba71835150ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "U.A.F. Ready GO! \\n～运动员们的闪耀时刻～",
      "source_fingerprint": "859f90f93a1d969759847d7964d6906b8bf3fdeedc019c9d0ac333733a981dd3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4726d2764d6228a8d548834e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "收获！饱餐！\\n大丰食祭",
      "source_fingerprint": "830a3a63544a57edf6c6756274ea6c5f63d6db9f41963605ca524abc0264eade",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e234c1152205f691c3ea8b41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "奔跑吧！机械赛马娘\\n-圆梦的发明-",
      "source_fingerprint": "168a5ae66343442b63ab4bd39ee1ee47f4063d7cf4b4979b22e574540e008c61",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "119",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f5f889071f42a57ed72553b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "史无前例的年幼学园理事长・秋川宣布\\n设立的新赛事<color=#FF6D26>『URA总决赛』</color>！\\n为了登上初代冠军宝座，\\n训练员与赛马娘齐心协力的战斗\\n现在，开始――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c628247e145f8780c5ab8419d74ec7e32cf91f2ae7ce0b15627508589b32c4ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:716b671fa4b116f43f11e1c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在闪耀系列赛面临危机时，\\n“传说”级的赛马娘们挺身而出！  \\n所有与比赛相关的人们齐心协力，\\n让闪耀系列赛 \\n再次焕发活力——并迈向未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdeda76a7b90473b2071789985a9f0a90eed4ace76b33112bc105b3a32f0ae95",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e689d0d7ea2ad7dff14adc59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "突然启动的无人岛计划。\\n乘着塔可布莱恩的梦想，\\n凭本能驰骋吧！燃烧吧，赛马娘！\\n为了将身心锤炼得更加狂野，\\n在此建造最强的训练设施吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d93fa33f7685035c2fccc12b6b929b81cfb60fd944d5d689dce7b839eeddbd2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4c2063338846ed6c0cf2703",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过着忙碌日常的赛马娘们，收到了一封\\n来自<color=#FF6D26>『汤驹温泉乡』</color>的治愈之旅邀请函。\\n然而温泉乡正面临着衰落的危机……！？\\n美好的人生，源于美好的休憩。\\n重新审视“疗养”，健康地生活吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30ea029016df43107465dbd4f01f366ee87205dde085aa6e28c8c0f360a54092",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3637eac2d15a30afb77946bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育马者杯。为了在这场世界最大规模的\\nG1盛典中夺得胜利，曾经的\\n挑战者夺金旅途发起了远征计划。\\n怀揣着各自的信念，赛马娘们\\n向世界发起挑战的日子就此开启！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb22026c20839a2c83414ef58a910bebe43a40346481863476e237cb0a8af1c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2a1eb202dc7bcb90ec9d16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用拉面向粉丝们报恩！\\n产生这个想法的赛马娘们，决定举办一场\\n全国性的拉面活动。\\n在获得了骏川手纲和光辉致意的协助后，\\n如今，特雷森轩正式挂起暖帘开张——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4294fdbb2d3c168ea7c3360a340095fe25af627fd0e40ef6fd95053de4f3897a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfbff85a47cd7c7e21013dea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "十二年一度的盛大祭典<color=#FF6D26>『午式骏大祭』</color>。\\n数位赛马娘被委以重任，任命为这场祭典中的特殊角色——神驹。\\n正如祭典的巫女所言『为了赛马娘与人类的羁绊』，\\n自此拉开序幕的，是一段连通往昔与——未来的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eb02e8de983bbc225452e21ee6c77c47d5b30fc58a85ef80b76130ee28fb801",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be63d22babd95b14691ae395",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "团结队伍！　新的青春！　……这时，\\n团队对抗战<color=#FF6D26>『青春杯』</color>突然开办\\n然而，还未开始享受其乐趣便听闻到学园的\\n危机！？　为了守护自由的特雷森学园\\n来吧，齐心协力夺取胜利吧――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27e1e8d3863e55883a9d851cdd5066e7ad86e98ce4805fdd6f0d6ead1b3ef10b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e21151d4857621460a40e2ae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘们为什么要举办Live？\\n在突然出现的制作人所提出的\\n<color=#FF6D26>『Grand Live』</color>计划中，赛马娘们\\n将再一次面对Live。\\n由此她们得出的答案是――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95e32570964b697df22b7f287a913363f1fa4646bca3afe61c4448f395af4d6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e2e7023e69302ec3687ea48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "媒体主导设立的新赛事\\n<color=#FF6D26>『闪耀明星巅峰赛』</color>\\n这是为决出最强者的战斗！\\n来吧，朝着梦想启程\\n以各项最强为目标吧――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b56eed1f9a50b0436646a42d8a5181d7cfa13985a3424c153f18e6ad3e78b432",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cd244f642d25ce4875a165d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出现在想要全力支持赛马娘的训练员们\\n面前的是，被冠以三女神之名的\\n助训AI。领受三女神的睿智，\\n以称霸赛马娘界的顶点赛事――\\n<color=#FF6D26>『Grand Masters』</color>为目标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f3a648dfe23eaa260365623fcca7fc0ad8806ef73ecea5b320fe3a06faad9d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbbb04cf382f68baef5ada45",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "世界最高峰的比赛『凯旋门赏』。不断有挑战者\\n力图赢取胜利。「今年誓要成为世界第一！」\\n特雷森学园设立了<color=#FF6D26>『L'Arc计划』</color>。\\n追寻梦想与浪漫的旅途，现已拉开帷幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77c456267b352a3f2290866f2efe770c2e7e5022f0ebdff09d844847c05a0da0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eca0ca8c0b49c1d99268d0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决出No.1运动员赛马娘的\\n综合体育大会<color=#FF6D26>『U.A.F.』</color>开幕！\\n赛马娘们将在15种独特的比赛中\\n挑战自我极限，挥洒汗水！\\n运动员们的灵魂共鸣，请拭目以待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8944b725bda56fdd898f043b86ee2d156a5ddaaca94ae2691a4a63cb35f8f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:163b8adade8cd58712a0c6cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随着秋川理事长宣布开放农田，\\n特雷森学园的大农耕时代开始了。\\n烈日之下，大家一起挥动锄头；\\n日落时分，众人共同围坐餐桌。\\n来吧，今天我们也去种田吧――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4245a5126f8c425e43eaf92edffb045cada30eadc262e4be7f8c909cc6124faf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7ad93c7255a7ea392ca365",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园中出现了机械赛马娘。\\n那是由天才博士砂糖光制作的机器人。\\n不过它还是初始型号，仍有许多问题……\\n让我们去强化它，来实现博士的梦想吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03568a8ece876de23aa2714308de226c4289f3902cf6aa19bee1a7101bca37a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b9c1b789322496bc59bf649",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9b7403a88a4e418b46366498f75a6027548a8d37f7703bc4c4059ad48f82b6e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9befb9684f2aedcdef89403c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "传奇",
      "source_fingerprint": "9be03a92c934c61c9b2cd7acbcf10356ecf821a3e8800c75b346a1992032485c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ddf0ae86c43c2d10371a47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "未冠",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f10fffc71d29135c2b2db5b65abf5bd4265b8ae6cd063a4deb19d9de4b925b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8508fa88a820fbcb9a426a57",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "初学者",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e88fbb082e96cb53db4cd24a66336ef19d597eb145318562d53834bbc57286e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a569acda53927d7f81847636",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "青铜",
      "source_fingerprint": "4608039c93643b11e4266732b39b159b391002925f344fba36be2f9da20728f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8adf6625e0c5082c8d53d67",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "白银",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ab15443bb5a257cf372b26679826f74950a88b3e220d0b3ff084c62146a1e2a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47ce459a190680773531fdbd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "黄金",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbb72f61f1175160de5b0114fb8e113341ef9377d751a734fe26ef38c110aa6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1414bccd83ab78919c5ea5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "白金",
      "source_fingerprint": "a883d3ec17ef58ad17c929315e80172264c24e91d12bafeb520855ddc3d2884e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80c2dd17bb480889ce692dea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "明星",
      "source_fingerprint": "61852f503151452e10f88d431c52e8da6fb3f923d965e0248bfb8e92aba270ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c55fccd2066fa52a33f9a5c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "顶级明星",
      "source_fingerprint": "22b25fefa5b3951ce6f191d3eac246b66b74e729b1383dee550b5747edc8cf55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869cd06e8c2a8d13896aa9c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "粉饰URA总决赛的欢快歌曲。\\n马儿跳♪马儿跳♪绝对能带起现场的气氛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca0a69d88943c4f2a6ba935358fa033fbc59b57bc8a9939007c9d0b8a4324070",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32534c621c0e3f52cad487cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我们两人一起，什么都可以做到！\\n这充满活力的乐曲，一定也能令你欢笑☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5050c0e710a6e76414cc064f905caf37e22d828f76b02998ff171e3cc8cf1396",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8413b24294453735b45a0a76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为和你一同奔跑ー\\n我们的旋律永远不会停止。已经，不会再回头了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d39ea31f558d5cad69cd63639f26896c1b6d8b49ae76eb25598569c49380920",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bd91d3bf294c19ef09f8edc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "仅赠予荣获三后冠的女王们的歌曲。\\n华丽的同时，也有着顽强追梦的美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80a55b72c2a740cff1f9760c28c28e5735e42fdf5cd90aca6aa814166601e7ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f812a8a4770d3d3afe8e2dbb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "献给刚出道赛马娘的首支歌曲。\\n吹响那开场号！响彻至终点吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "253236cd6601347b62670db8bec41a60e6d01f6b0b49164e7693f8613b894889",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:082c951d547d52abdfc82222",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在新马级比赛中表现出色的希望之星们展现的清爽乐曲。\\n赛马娘们疾驰着，她们的梦想闪耀着七色的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f371580e198265e7db1e610301664c7f66a398b93354c0abeae3e04be3b5ced0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c43ce2538bc2cf1f1d7249d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只有以顶点为目标，不懈努力之人才能抵达。\\nNEXT FRONTIER――这是为永盛不衰的霸者设立的舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c2abad9b89360bb5d985eccb540592ecacaeb3fe094c633eec082e38077c1cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ceaec0846bade035eb9c52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赠予即使在泥泞之中也以不屈斗志战斗下去的赛马娘的灵魂之歌。\\n即使被疾风骤雨夺去视线，脚步也不会停止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08c402d5af3d6f7331266206ea14505e686c73614b64d80aeaeee15e2db9de73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:524437de3ce445f93754f76b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "照亮GⅠ胜利这一特别的瞬间，在天空绽放的歌曲。\\n只要一直追寻想要实现的未来的话，梦想就一定会实现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3facaa36bbf7bb1d711f925fe82b210472b6cc0121ca03aac4be7969dfb01ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43443b41e5b8f9645c1ec7ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论奔跑还是玩耍，我们都全力以赴！　用旋律来承载\\n大家缤纷的梦想――Let's Go Starting Gate!",
      "source_fingerprint": "dee200ed6fca9f666e15df40ab35ff8f946f45fa1834e9d1be666b1d9f98ce25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af1dcfb7fbeb84d4e7b2a54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "星光照亮前路，你的未来充满光明。\\n为支持我的人们表达感谢的1曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7641ddc99e7ffeb05e026364d9bba1df777bf3d5166ab0d398a9850fb17c6ade",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dc6c1ef4029f090a2ee316c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "キラキラ！トキメキ！ただ輝く景色を駆け抜ければいい！\\nだって、僕らは愛されるために生まれてきたのだからっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73103edd8673496b46e80d574eca927d92a6e86ad5235e4e8327975002ace8f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a08773c1635145f9c653503",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "经常吵架，也互不道歉――但是，想永远一起欢笑下去。\\n这是青涩而又略带苦涩的，我们的友情应援歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0d3797827b94fee2e8976b0de37eceade8a45baf959b6798ccec16e26701f01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4356f25f4741607a818a6b75",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把过去、现在所经历过的全部装进宝箱，面向未来！\\n――来吧，让整个世界充满『最喜欢了！』吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e02d74559e808073ffeb2a8ef6329c1fc7177c59ec1755ab2bb469d0800f140",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34bcf34bd6b40461dd198bea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "疾驰的一等星闪耀着，充满勇气与希望的歌曲。\\n心动的预感――那就是比赛开始的信号",
      "source_fingerprint": "316e2a7163d6866624623d20eb585422f060c2a13763ce6ddae613c616b180a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b617fbe398dac5891c75ec7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若我启程奔跑的话——这是一首融入了虚幻而坚强意志的歌曲。\\n将的思念藏在心中，向夜空中高悬的明月祈祷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e905da63e6e793b2e43a4f06587a18e8bc2209eba77821546a19d68debad554",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d1498bbabc0338106c4409b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "心中所起誓的是『最快』二字！　直到极限的尽头\\n疾驰的赛马娘们遵循本能地呼喊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58d11166ef0fea76dec387749bf2fd196b5992cef50c8c12d3f8e75670795f01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:317744a81c16e2f2bc618e52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只有赢得经典三冠者才有资格演唱的歌曲。\\n这首歌曲是所有赛马娘的『向往』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "586fb412869663ed682723ec58b0a1ebc22a47971c6efa5095a89d0d0de18b76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fe1b6fe8e6d5a57c7f8e100",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要与你一决胜负。少女们心怀绝不退让的信念，登上舞台。\\n无论是灯火或是烟花……无论怎样的光芒，都绝不可能比身为“主人公”的她们更为闪耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "451e1bf65f2a4495d2cedac5a3e005536f03281342ef3df4a281853565d4b362",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b89010f4405f60f723dba30f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为有认真的你陪在身边，我才不论何时都能朝着胜利冲刺！\\n充满活力的青春之歌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "903059c11428286414447e28b27c7b6750c61944fd255502e9019b86b5fab5c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43b89551a25dd48b4a2ff954",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对比赛的渴望、执着、焦燥……能感受到炽热而沉重的灵魂的歌曲。\\n即使依旧被命运所囚禁，也无法停止追寻希望的脚步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4384c7ab92038ef64b37e3277341dd9f2c6002d19938260af892da0e53b5438",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9743508c73999cd1196c3ae4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与劲敌一同演唱的爽畅歌曲。\\n『我将与你一同追寻梦想』――这是个铭刻于心的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e55e4f89854dc11ac05cd4c9f79e2d6ba262a2c70ca3651dbd0f9b704e2ceab0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507f1caa3e66bf528e406006",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首乐曲中寄托着大家对未来的憧憬，即便是满天繁星也不及\\n这份心意那般耀眼。你也应是观众之一——梦幻灯光秀，开幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed00fb0f71fe1f9c231f165a2983f1e5fc26c0beeb5ff0a741735909f7d5d637",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9680c95dbe96a9a386e62b7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有欢笑也有泪水！将赛马娘们的悠闲时光\\n咻♪的一下塞进去的学园生活之歌☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1a697247f2a4d9865c8c630c406626610657a1ec91cf10f70d6c43d10e02e52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5540d834b3601b910967023a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『因为已不是独自一人，所以才会变得更强』\\n大家一起哭泣、欢笑、奔跑――这是牵绊与青春的旋律。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0488fa70f0a556bacb822c2376f4fc56ee9d96b55d384e93b4973a6f15b55865",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c89f0e476ce770ed31a53f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超越春夏秋冬，只为与你共奏一曲合音。\\n胸中激昂的心跳化作旋律——终于，遇见大家了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8b6418ea46c154ae2556d6d2190b112faeeac88ebbf3c72abb1f4ff3e4601a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da41ce34e2a1d18aee6b11db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向着未知的终点，未曾见过的景色――\\n神秘而又温暖的旋律，推动着你，轻语道：『奔跑起来吧』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98a180c0907dc3357b0dae3151c6ab1a57d7ec74d42f55f1e6cbfc1290ef7b42",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2a3767321b11ae9cbca3b40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "友情、竞争、眼泪、笑容、不安、希望――\\n全部都是闪闪发光着的歌♪『青春』一定就是这样的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e50b55d8423cf9573edd350559d6daf12e1ca9752f11b1663599c9645aeb130f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:001d948bfb04b0b9edc11858",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "描绘了互相切磋的少女们的心意的乐曲。\\n梦想多么高远、多么宽广、多么蔚蓝生辉。来，一同前行吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddbec9999bc68a0bb15899e52500f78e4bc5afbc0af44e45f19295a434dad578",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ded1aefad3969e2e268d2d74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要向着梦想奔跑。这是谱写了这份决心的乐曲。\\n即使迷茫，即使不安，也要向前迈进。将这首歌作为路标。",
